---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Meet Kylie Kelly | Email Marketing Educator & Podcast Host" description="From burnt-out wedding photographer to a multi six-figure business built entirely on email. Meet Kylie Kelly, host of The Email Growth Show.">

  <section class="bg-black text-white px-6 py-20">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <p class="script-accent text-pink text-xl mb-3">hi, I'm Kylie</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold mb-6">I'm Kylie Kelly...</h1>
      <p class="text-warmgray mb-4">
        I help women stop chasing visibility and start building it properly. The kind that leads to trust. Demand. And clients who already know they want to work with you.
      </p>
      <p class="text-warmgray">
        I teach a quieter, more intentional way to grow: through email, collaborations, podcasting, and thoughtfully built rooms that do the selling for you. No paid ads. No content treadmill. No pretending you enjoy showing up every day.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="px-6 py-16">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-3 text-center gap-6 mb-16">
      <div><p class="font-serif text-3xl font-bold">15+</p><p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-muted mt-2">years self-employed</p></div>
      <div><p class="font-serif text-3xl font-bold">7k+</p><p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-muted mt-2">clients helped &amp; supported</p></div>
      <div><p class="font-serif text-3xl font-bold">18</p><p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-muted mt-2">months to grow her list without social or paid ads</p></div>
    </div>

    <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto space-y-10">
      <div>
        <p class="text-pink text-xs uppercase tracking-wide font-semibold mb-1">2020&ndash;2022</p>
        <p class="text-muted">Rebuilding her life while trying to rebuild an income. Two kids. A global pause. A lot of uncertainty. She knew that if she wanted stability, she couldn't rely on algorithms or luck.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="text-pink text-xs uppercase tracking-wide font-semibold mb-1">May 2022</p>
        <p class="text-muted">Hosted her first online room. No fancy funnel, no audience hype. Just the right people, in the right space. Her email list grew quickly and her first online sales came in quietly, consistently, and without social media noise.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="text-pink text-xs uppercase tracking-wide font-semibold mb-1">September 2022</p>
        <p class="text-muted">The moment it clicked: visibility didn't need to be louder. It needed to be intentional.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="text-pink text-xs uppercase tracking-wide font-semibold mb-1">2023&ndash;now</p>
        <p class="text-muted">Built another room, then another. Same outcome. More trust, more momentum, more ease. What mattered wasn't the platform, it was the container.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-offwhite px-6 py-16">
    <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center">
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold mb-6">Let's build a visibility strategy that actually feels good, one that attracts aligned leads, gets you known in your industry, and gives you more time for the life you're actually building all of this for.</h2>
      <a href="/services" class="btn-primary">Explore Working Together →</a>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
